[Mission.Objectives]
Break out of encirclement.
[Mission.Description]
By the middle of July, most of France has been occupied by German troops. German armored divisions broke through French defense lines and reached the coast line with a swift thrust. Paris fell on June 14 and the French government escaped to Bordeaux.

Objective:
-	break out of encirclement.
[Mission.Success]
Mission accomplished!
[Mission.Failed]
Mission failed! Your troops died!
[Submission1.Objectives]
Save the French soldiers.
[Submission1.Description]
A small French infantry detachment is surrounded and is hiding in an isolated farmstead. German infantry is approaching.

Objective:
- 	save the French soldiers from death.
[Submission1.Success]
Mission accomplished!
[Submission1.Failed]
Mission failed!
